              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sherbear60"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Turned out very good! I added onions and garlic to the bacon and used more bacon, then deglazed the pan with wine before adding in the milk and cream cheese. The cream cheese was lumpy and never did fully melt. An immersion blender would have been great for this. Still was very delicious, but quite \"heavy\", definitely not a guilt free dinner.",
